id: pm-review-release-caller-rollout
title: Adopt the released reusable Daily Release caller
description: "Fleet rollout for unbraind/pm-ops#272 after the successful pm-jira cross-repository OIDC pilot. Replace copied release orchestration with the released SHA caller, matching validator, explicit empty changelog hooks and package-owned caller contracts. No merge, dispatch or publication."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: "area:release","gh:unbraind/pm-ops#272"
created_at: "2026-11-14T22:26:05.159Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-19T09:54:37.307Z"
author: codex-ops272-1114
comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T22:26:11.783Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Orient and start the authorized fleet rollout. Verified released v2026.11.14 at 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c. Preserve this package approval, schedule, preparation and publication hooks through canonical inputs. The merged Jira pilot proves cross-repository npm identity acceptance; this package must still pass its own first-run preflight. Run caller contracts, installed attestation, strict YAML, actionlint and regenerated changelog checks. Shared-runner hold gates every push. No review-thread action, merge, dispatch or publication."
  "2026-11-14T22:39:11.183Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Rolled the Jira pilot contract into this package: released workflow pin 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c (v2026.11.14), exact pm-ops 2026.11.14 validator, explicit include-empty changelog generation/check/notes hooks, and declared yaml for caller tests. Preserved package-owned approval, schedule and preparation inputs. Focused gates passed 40/40, zero failures/skips; linked caller test passed 6/6 in a scratch pm project to avoid tracker run artifacts. Reverting only release.yml to the old copy in a disposable fixture failed 5 of 6 contracts. Actionlint passed 1/1, strict workflow/Dependabot YAML parsing 2/2, installed publish-attestation passed 1/1. Regenerate changelog and check after this final tracker write. Full npm/Bun certification remains with CI; no full local pass is claimed. Cross-repository npm OIDC evidence is Jira run 43639146392, recorded on pm-ops#272; first package activation must still pass its preflight. This package has no npm trusted publisher: releases remain red at the OIDC step until the owner configures the publisher for this repository and release.yml. Every push waits on the shared-runner hold. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action. Leave this item open and release only this author claim."
  "2026-11-15T00:17:04.420Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 audit found release-copy remnants or package-level regression tests needing restoration. Keep the pinned caller and package hooks; remove obsolete local release orchestration and stale references, restore independent package behavior tests, and retarget mutation proofs to the caller contract. Run touched tests, unchanged coverage gates, typecheck and lint, then regenerate and check the changelog after final tracker writes. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread actions."
  "2026-11-15T00:54:51.302Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 for https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/pull/86: Removed the unused local review-thread mutation helper and its implementation-only tests, plus the obsolete inline pack-command extraction test. Retained package packing gates and added the retirement caller contract. Targeted tests passed 46/46. Full npm run coverage certification is delegated to exact-head CI at unchanged thresholds. npm run typecheck and npm run lint passed. Retirement contract passes and restoring only a retired artefact fails in a disposable copy. Linked tests passed in a copied scratch tracker, keeping run artefacts outside this tracker. Regenerate and check the changelog after this final tracker write. CI must verify the pushed head; no merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action. Releases remain red at the npm OIDC step until the owner configures this package trusted publisher for release.yml."
  "2026-11-19T02:04:20.298Z",codex-sol,"Daily Release candidate PR #90 for 2026.10.12 failed with Live publication identity disagrees. npm published at 2026-10-26T10:43:39.246Z before trusted preparation at 2026-11-16T11:45:18Z. No attestation, tag, GitHub Release or recorded workflow publication attempt exists for this intent. The protected merge matches the receipt. Read-only replay at c46a241 returns occupied and retains the historical receipt on retirement. Pin the shared workflow to v2026.11.18 with existing inputs and permissions."
  "2026-11-19T02:09:25.188Z",codex-sol,The linked release caller contract and changelog check both passed. Rollout is pending review and scheduled reconciliation.
  "2026-11-19T03:41:25.840Z",codex-sol,"Updated docs/release-caller-rollout.md to the pm-ops v2026.11.18 caller SHA c46a2419c63af3b348e6b559b0733ab0d9942cc7. Pinned the package-side pm-ops dev dependency and lockfile to 2026.11.18 (previously 2026.11.14). With tags fetched, npm run changelog:full and npm run changelog:check passed. The caller tests passed 7/7, the linked documentation contracts passed 80/80, and npm run typecheck passed."
  "2026-11-19T09:00:36.491Z",codex-sol,Round DL updates README install instructions for the published package and verifies each documented archive path in a fresh consumer.
  "2026-11-19T09:54:34.879Z",codex-sol,"Round DL updated the registry and local archive instructions. npm run build && npm run build:test && node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/closeout-evidence.test.ts test/release-approval.test.ts passed (36 passing, 0 skipped). npm run typecheck, npm run docstring and npm run test:install passed. All 1 README archive example(s) executed successfully in fresh consumers with the version produced by the source checkout. The changelog generation and check passed with tags fetched."
